# Project-local domains for the RF signal path. RF signal flow is typed
# information about a waveform, not a conserved balance the compile-time
# checker can settle — so it is a data-class domain typed by protocol
# (spec §2.2: data ports are typed by protocol/schema, not by balance).
# The DC and mains feeds use the stdlib electrical domain, which IS conserved.
domain rf_coax {
  class data
  doc "Guided RF/IF signal path over coaxial or waveguide; protocol names band and level plan."
}

domain freq_ref {
  class data
  doc "Frequency reference distribution (10 MHz / 1 PPS)."
}
